## About POAP KINGS

POAP KINGS is a Clash Royale clan that celebrates effort with proof. The clan originally published POAP digital collectibles for seasons and milestones. The POAP company and product have since ceased operating, so new collectibles can no longer be published. The clan kept its name and what it came to mean internally: "Proof of Arena Push." The current roster is refreshed locally from the Clash Royale API and pushed when it changes.

