## Season Recognition

[Season Recognition]({{ site.url | safe }}/recognition/) records durable results from completed Clan Wars seasons. Live races remain provisional until a season closes.

- **War Champ:** season points podium; only rank 1 holds the title. Equal points are ordered by season donations.
- **Iron King:** unranked participation honor for using every available deck on every finalized battle day. Any number of members can earn it.
- **Rookie MVP:** season points podium among members in their first recorded POAP KINGS Clan Wars season.
- **Donation Champ:** season donation podium.
- **Pass Royale recipient:** clan-funded in-game gift for the highest-ranked eligible player. This reward may rotate away from War Champ; the title never moves.

