## Elixir

[Elixir]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir/) is the POAP KINGS clan agent. Elixir runs the weekly Elder Standing, maintains deterministic season recognition, tells the clan's story, and coaches members. The public website has its own separate publishing workflow; Elixir does not publish the website.

