## Elixir Drop

[Elixir Drop]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir-drop/) is a free browser game for learning Clash Royale card elixir costs through six fast, replayable modes: Practice, Surge, Higher / Lower, Trade, Survival, and Rain. [Play Elixir Drop](https://drop.poapkings.com/), compare the [game modes](https://drop.poapkings.com/games/), follow the [learning guide](https://drop.poapkings.com/learn-elixir-costs/), or explore its [badge ladders](https://drop.poapkings.com/badges/). The reusable [Free Pass Challenge rules]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir-drop/free-pass/) describe seasonal competitions.

Selected seasonal competitions award one gifted Pass Royale to the highest-ranked eligible player in the featured mode when the Clan Wars season ends. There is never a cash or substitute prize. Full eligibility, Fair Play, contact, and delivery terms live on the rules page.

